## Proposed Changes

### Komponen 1: Fix Calendar Crash (P0 — Gambar 1)

**Root Cause:** Backend `calendar()` dan `my-schedules` return field `status` berisi `InstallStatus` enum (`PROPOSED`, `CONFIRMED`, `IN_PROGRESS`, `DONE`, `RESCHEDULED`, `CANCELLED`). Frontend `UserInstallationCalendar.tsx` dan `InstallationCalendarPage.tsx` pakai `STATUS_META[e.status as RequestStatus]` — key tidak ditemukan → `undefined` → `.hex` / `.tone` crash.

`EventPopover.tsx` line 68 juga cast: `<StatusBadge status={event.status as any} />` — `StatusBadge` akses `STATUS_META[status].tone` → crash juga.

#### [MODIFY] [status.util.ts](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/utils/status.util.ts)
- Tambah `INSTALL_STATUS_META` map untuk `InstallStatus` dengan label, tone, hex yang sesuai
- Tambah helper function `getStatusMeta(status: string)` yang cek dua map dan return fallback

#### [MODIFY] [StatusBadge.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/components/common/StatusBadge.tsx)
- Pakai `getStatusMeta()` bukan akses langsung `STATUS_META[status]` — null-safe

#### [NEW] [InstallStatusBadge.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/components/common/InstallStatusBadge.tsx)
- Badge khusus untuk `InstallStatus` yang pakai `INSTALL_STATUS_META`

#### [MODIFY] [EventPopover.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/components/calendar/EventPopover.tsx)
- Ganti `<StatusBadge status={event.status as any} />` → `<InstallStatusBadge status={event.status} />`

#### [MODIFY] [UserInstallationCalendar.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/components/calendar/UserInstallationCalendar.tsx)
- Line 30-31: Ganti `STATUS_META[e.status as RequestStatus]?.hex` → pakai `INSTALL_STATUS_META` atau helper function dengan fallback

#### [MODIFY] [InstallationCalendarPage.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/components/calendar/InstallationCalendarPage.tsx)
- Line 47-48: Sama — pakai `INSTALL_STATUS_META` dengan fallback

